---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
const sections = [
  { id: 'collect', title: 'What we collect' },
  { id: 'third-party', title: 'Third-party content' },
  { id: 'use', title: 'How we use it' },
  { id: 'retention', title: 'How long we keep it' },
  { id: 'choices', title: 'Your choices' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes' },
];
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy | RHSP"
  description="How Round Hole Square Peg Technologies handles information on this website."
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  heading="Your information, kept simple."
  intro="This site has no accounts, no forms and no ads. Here is the little information we do handle, and why."
  updated="6 November 2026"
  sections={sections}
>
  <section id="collect" class="legal-section">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Emails you send us.</strong> If you write to letstalk@rhsp.solutions or a founder, we receive your email address and whatever you choose to share. We use it only to reply and to discuss work with you.</li>
      <li><strong>Theme preference.</strong> Your light or dark mode choice is saved in your browser so it is remembered. It never leaves your device.</li>
      <li><strong>Basic server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider may record technical data such as IP address, browser type and pages requested, for security and reliability.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="third-party" class="legal-section">
    <h2>Third-party content</h2>
    <p>Demo videos load from YouTube in privacy-enhanced mode. Map and social links take you to Google Maps, LinkedIn and X, which have their own privacy policies.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="use" class="legal-section">
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use your information only to respond to you and to run and secure this website. We do not sell it. We share it only with service providers that help us operate the site and email, or where the law requires.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="retention" class="legal-section">
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep emails for as long as needed to handle your enquiry and meet legal obligations, then delete them.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="choices" class="legal-section">
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing <a href="mailto:letstalk@rhsp.solutions">letstalk@rhsp.solutions</a>. We respond in line with applicable Indian law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes" class="legal-section">
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this page and will change the date at the top when we do.</p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>